# Config binding

Bind in `Program.cs`. Missing `Postgres`, `ServiceInfo`, or `RabbitMQ` throw `ConfigurationError`. Pass typed records into `Init*`. Do not read `IConfiguration` in handlers.

```csharp
var postgres = builder.Configuration.GetSection("Postgres").Get<PostgresConfig>()
    ?? throw new ConfigurationError("Секция Postgres обязательна в конфигурации.");
var serviceInfo = builder.Configuration.GetSection(ServiceInfoOptions.SectionName).Get<ServiceInfoOptions>()
    ?? throw new ConfigurationError("Секция ServiceInfo обязательна в конфигурации.");
var rabbitMq = builder.Configuration.GetSection(RabbitMQOptions.SectionName).Get<RabbitMQOptions>()
    ?? throw new ConfigurationError("Секция RabbitMQ обязательна в конфигурации.");
```
